 scripts.\n- `testutils`: Utilities for testing.\n\n### `cmd` Directory\nContains command-line applications:\n- `claw`: Main command-line application.\n  - `main.go`: Entry point for the claw application.\n- `level3-test`: Test-related command-line application.\n  - `main.go`: Entry point for the level3-test application.\n- `task-runner`: Task runner command-line application.\n  - `main.go`: Entry point for the task-runner application.\n\n### `docs` Directory\nContains project documentation:\n- `api.md`: API documentation.\n- `example.md`: Example usage documentation.\n- `overview.md`: High-level overview of the project.\n\n### `integration` Directory\nContains integration test files:\n- `level3_integration_test.go`: Integration tests for level3.\n\n### `internal` Directory\nContains internal packages:\n- `context`: Context-related functionality.\n  - `context.go`: Context implementation.\n- `engine`: Engine or core logic.\n  - `loop.go`: Core loop implementation.\n  - `loop_test.go`: Tests for the core loop.\n- `feishu`: Feishu-related functionality.\n  - `feishu.go`: Feishu implementation.\n- `logger`: Logging functionality.\n  - `logger.go`: Logger implementation.\n- `memory`: Memory-related functionality.\n  - `memory.go`: Memory implementation.\n- `provider`: Provider-related functionality.\n  - `claude.go`: Claude provider implementation.\n  - `deepseek.go`: Deepseek provider implementation.\n  - `glm47.go`: GLM47 provider implementation.\n  - `interface.go`: Provider interface.\n  - `minimax.go`: Minimax provider implementation.\n  - `openai.go`: OpenAI provider implementation.\n  - `siliconflow.go`: Siliconflow provider implementation.\n- `schema`: Schema-related functionality.\n  - `message.go`: Message schema implementation.\n- `tools`: Utility tools.\n  - `bash.go`: Bash tool implementation.\n  - `edit_file.go`: File editing tool.\n  - `read_file.go`: File reading tool.\n  - `registry.go`: Registry implementation.\n  - `tools_test.go`: Tests for tools.\n  - `write_file.go`: File writing tool.\n\n### `logs` Directory\nContains log files:\n- `claw-2026-05-04.log`: Log file for the claw application.\n\n### `scripts` Directory\nContains utility scripts:\n- `test-e2e.sh`: End-to-end test script.\n\n### `testutils` Directory\nContains testing utilities:\n- `mock_provider.go`: Mock provider for testing.\n- `test_helpers.go`: Helper functions for tests."}
